<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8"%>
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
  <meta name="description" content="동국씨엠 MES 칼라 개발 관리 화면 사용자 매뉴얼">
  <title>칼라 개발 관리 | MES 사용자 매뉴얼</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --fg: #1f2328;
      --muted: #59636e;
      --border: #d0d7de;
      --border-muted: #d8dee4;
      --canvas: #ffffff;
      --subtle: #f6f8fa;
      --accent: #0969da;
      --accent-soft: #ddf4ff;
      --success: #1a7f37;
      --success-soft: #dafbe1;
      --attention: #9a6700;
      --attention-soft: #fff8c5;
      --danger: #cf222e;
      --danger-soft: #ffebe9;
      --header: #24292f;
      --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(140, 149, 159, .18);
      --radius: 6px;
      --content: 980px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 82px; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--fg);
      background: var(--canvas);
      font: 14px/1.65 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
    }
    a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    button, input { font: inherit; }
    kbd {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      color: var(--fg);
      background: var(--subtle);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-muted);
      border-bottom-width: 2px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .topbar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      height: 64px;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--header);
      border-bottom: 1px solid #57606a;
    }
    .topbar-inner {
      max-width: 1440px;
      height: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, var(--content));
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 48px;
    }
    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      min-width: max-content;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
      padding-left: 10px;
    }
    .topbar-tools { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; min-width: 0; }
    .search-wrap { position: relative; flex: 1; max-width: 520px; margin-left: auto; }
    .doc-search {
      width: 100%;
      height: 34px;
      padding: 5px 82px 5px 34px;
      color: #fff;
      background: #24292f;
      border: 1px solid #57606a;
      border-radius: 6px;
      outline: none;
    }
    .doc-search:focus { border-color: #58a6ff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(56,139,253,.28); }
    .doc-search::placeholder { color: #afb8c1; }
    .search-icon { position: absolute; left: 11px; top: 8px; color: #afb8c1; }
    .search-shortcut { position: absolute; right: 8px; top: 7px; color: #afb8c1; font-size: 12px; }
    .header-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .header-button {
      height: 34px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      color: #fff;
      background: #2f363d;
      border: 1px solid #57606a;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .header-button:hover { background: #3b434b; }

    .progress { position: fixed; top: 64px; left: 0; z-index: 101; width: 0; height: 3px; background: #2f81f7; }
    .layout {
      max-width: 1440px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 24px 80px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, var(--content));
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 48px;
    }
    .sidebar { position: relative; }
    .toc {
      position: sticky;
      top: 92px;
      max-height: calc(100vh - 116px);
      overflow: auto;
      padding-right: 12px;
    }
    .toc a {
      display: block;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      border-left: 2px solid transparent;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .toc a:hover { color: var(--fg); text-decoration: none; }
    .toc a.active { color: var(--fg); border-left-color: #fd8c73; font-weight: 600; }
    .toc .sub { padding-left: 24px; font-size: 12px; }
    .toc .major { color: var(--fg); font-weight: 700; }
    .toc a.major.active { font-weight: 700; }

    main { min-width: 0; }
    .hero { padding-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted); }
    .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; }
    h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.25; }
    h1 { margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px); letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    h2 { margin: 48px 0 16px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted); font-size: 24px; }
    h3 { margin: 30px 0 12px; font-size: 18px; }
    h2 .anchor, h3 .anchor { margin-left: 6px; color: transparent; font-weight: 400; }
    h2:hover .anchor, h3:hover .anchor { color: var(--accent); }
    p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .lead { max-width: 760px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; }
    .meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1px 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--subtle);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .badge.blue { color: #0550ae; background: var(--accent-soft); border-color: #54aeff66; }
    .badge.green { color: var(--success); background: var(--success-soft); border-color: #4ac26b66; }
    .badge.yellow { color: var(--attention); background: var(--attention-soft); border-color: #d4a72c66; }

    .callout {
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-muted);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--subtle);
    }
    .callout strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .callout.warn { border-left-color: #bf8700; background: var(--attention-soft); }
    .callout.danger { border-left-color: var(--danger); background: var(--danger-soft); }
    .callout.success { border-left-color: var(--success); background: var(--success-soft); }

    .update-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .card {
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-muted);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--canvas);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(27,31,36,.04);
    }
    .card .num { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--accent); font: 650 20px/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; }
    .card strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }

    .screen-figure { margin: 20px 0 8px; }
    .screen-frame {
      position: relative;
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--subtle);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .screen-canvas { position: relative; min-width: 900px; line-height: 0; }
    .screen-canvas img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
    .zone {
      position: absolute;
      border: 2px solid #0969da;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: rgba(9,105,218,.07);
      transition: background .2s, box-shadow .2s;
    }
    .zone:hover { background: rgba(9,105,218,.14); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(9,105,218,.2); }
    .zone span {
      position: absolute;
      top: -13px;
      left: -13px;
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #fff;
      background: #0969da;
      border: 2px solid #fff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font: 700 13px/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
    }
    .z1 { left: 5.2%; top: 4%; width: 9.1%; height: 4.4%; }
    .z2 { left: 2.5%; top: 8.4%; width: 79.4%; height: 9.1%; }
    .z3 { left: 82.2%; top: 8.9%; width: 14.5%; height: 4.3%; }
    .z4 { left: 2.6%; top: 17.4%; width: 10.8%; height: 3.8%; }
    .z5 { left: 2.6%; top: 21.1%; width: 97.3%; height: 53%; }
    .z6 { left: 3%; top: 93.7%; width: 96.3%; height: 3%; }
    .attachment-delete-canvas { min-width: 753px; }
    .instruction-zone {
      position: absolute;
      border: 4px solid #0969da;
      border-radius: 5px;
      background: rgba(9,105,218,.08);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.88);
    }
    .instruction-zone span {
      position: absolute;
      top: -17px;
      left: -17px;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #fff;
      background: #0969da;
      border: 3px solid #fff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font: 700 14px/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.32);
    }
    .attachment-button-zone { left: 16.1%; top: .5%; width: 8.7%; height: 6%; }
    .attachment-button-zone span { top: calc(100% - 15px); left: -20px; }
    .delete-action-zone { left: 81.5%; top: 73.2%; width: 4.6%; height: 15.6%; }
    figcaption { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
    .legend { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 8px 24px; margin: 16px 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .legend li { display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: flex-start; }
    .legend-num {
      flex: 0 0 24px;
      height: 24px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 16px 0 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-radius: var(--radius); }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0; }
    th, td { padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted); text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
    th { background: var(--subtle); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    tbody tr:hover { background: #f6f8fa99; }
    code { padding: .15em .35em; background: rgba(175,184,193,.2); border-radius: 4px; font: 85% ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; }
    .required { color: var(--danger); font-weight: 700; }

    .steps { margin: 18px 0 28px; padding: 0; list-style: none; counter-reset: step; }
    .steps > li { position: relative; min-height: 56px; padding: 0 0 22px 48px; counter-increment: step; }
    .steps > li::before {
      content: counter(step);
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--success);
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .steps > li:not(:last-child)::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 14px; top: 32px; bottom: 2px; width: 2px; background: var(--border-muted); }
    .steps strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .steps p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .attachment-actions { margin: 14px 0; padding: 12px 14px; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0; background: var(--subtle); }
    .attachment-actions p + p { margin-top: 8px; }

    details { margin: 10px 0; border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--canvas); }
    summary { padding: 12px 14px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
    details > div { padding: 0 14px 14px; color: var(--muted); }
    details[open] summary { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-muted); margin-bottom: 12px; }

    .status-flow { display: flex; align-items: center; width: 100%; gap: 4px; overflow: hidden; padding: 12px 0 18px; }
    .status-node { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; padding: 10px 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--subtle); text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
    .status-arrow { flex: 0 0 auto; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; }
    mark.search-hit { padding: 0 2px; background: #fff8c5; border-radius: 2px; }
    mark.search-hit.current { background: #ffdf5d; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #bf8700; }
    .search-status { display: none; margin: 14px 0; padding: 10px 12px; color: var(--muted); background: var(--subtle); border: 1px solid var(--border-muted); border-radius: var(--radius); }
    .search-status.visible { display: block; }
    .footer { margin-top: 56px; padding-top: 22px; color: var(--muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-muted); font-size: 12px; }
    .back-top { position: fixed; right: 20px; bottom: 20px; display: none; width: 40px; height: 40px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--canvas); box-shadow: var(--shadow); cursor: pointer; }
    .back-top.show { display: block; }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .topbar-inner { display: flex; gap: 18px; }
      .topbar-tools { display: contents; }
      .brand { padding-left: 0; }
      .layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); padding-top: 18px; }
      .sidebar { display: none; }
      .update-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .legend { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .topbar { height: auto; }
      .topbar-inner { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; }
      .search-wrap { order: 3; flex-basis: 100%; max-width: none; }
      .header-actions { margin-left: auto; }
      .progress { top: 98px; }
      .layout { padding: 22px 16px 64px; }
      h2 { margin-top: 40px; }
      .meta { display: grid; gap: 4px; }
      .header-button .wide-label { display: none; }
      .status-flow { gap: 2px; }
      .status-node { padding: 8px 3px; white-space: normal; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.2; }
      .status-arrow { font-size: 12px; }
    }
    @media print {
      .topbar, .sidebar, .progress, .back-top, .reset-checks { display: none !important; }
      body { font-size: 11pt; }
      .layout { display: block; max-width: none; padding: 0; }
      main { max-width: none; }
      h2 { break-after: avoid; margin-top: 28px; }
      .card, .callout, details, tr { break-inside: avoid; }
      details > div { display: block !important; }
      .screen-frame { overflow: visible; box-shadow: none; }
      .screen-canvas { min-width: 0; }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="문서 맨 위로">
        <span>칼라 개발 관리 · 사용자 매뉴얼</span>
      </a>
      <div class="topbar-tools">
        <div class="search-wrap">
          <span class="search-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span>
          <input id="docSearch" class="doc-search" type="search" placeholder="궁금한 점이 있다면, 키워드를 검색해보세요!" autocomplete="off" aria-label="궁금한 점이 있다면, 키워드를 검색해보세요!">
          <span class="search-shortcut"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd> <kbd>K</kbd></span>
        </div>
        <div class="header-actions">
          <button class="header-button" type="button" onclick="window.print()" title="인쇄 또는 PDF 저장">⎙ <span class="wide-label">인쇄</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div id="progress" class="progress" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="layout">
    <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="문서 목차">
      <nav class="toc" id="toc">
        <a class="major" href="#overview">칼라 개발 관리</a>
        <a class="major" href="#status">개발진도</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#status-definition">개발진도의 정의</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#status-management">개발진도 관리 개요</a>
        <a class="major" href="#screen-map">메인화면</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#screen-map">화면 구성</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#search-fields">검색 조건</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#list-columns">목록 항목</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#buttons">버튼 기능</a>
        <a class="major" href="#detail-form">상세화면</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#detail-form">신규등록 및 항목 설명</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#detail-request-fields">의뢰내용의 입력항목</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#detail-progress">개발진도 및 확정관리</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#detail-history">첨부파일 및 특이사항</a>
        <a class="major" href="#scenarios">업무별 사용예시</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#scenario-search">조건 조회</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#scenario-register">신규 등록</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#scenario-review">건별 확인</a>
        <a class="sub" href="#scenario-delete">삭제</a>
        <a class="major" href="#troubleshooting">문제 해결</a>
        <a class="major" href="#planned-updates">업데이트 예정사항</a>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero" id="overview" data-searchable>
        <div class="eyebrow">DONGKUK CM 칼라개발관리 가이드</div>
        <h1>칼라 개발 관리</h1>
        <p class="lead">칼라 제품의 개발 진행에 대해 진도 현황에 맞추어 쉽고 정확하고 조회하고 관리할 수 있는 시스템에 대한 안내서입니다.</p>
        <div class="meta">
          <span><strong>대상:</strong> 영업팀, 생산/기술 검토 부서, 개발 담당자</span>
          <span><strong>기준 화면:</strong> 칼라 개발 관리 목록</span>
          <span><strong>문서 버전:</strong> 1.3 (2026-08-11)</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="status" data-searchable>
        <h2>개발진도 <a class="anchor" href="#status" aria-label="개발진도 링크">#</a></h2>
        <h3 id="status-definition">개발진도의 정의 <a class="anchor" href="#status-definition" aria-label="개발진도의 정의 링크">#</a></h3>
        <p>신규등록 상세화면에서 다음 전체 개발진도를 확인했습니다. 각 단계의 담당부서는 영업담당자가 등록 시 지정하며, 담당부서는 해당 진도의 처리 대상을 조회해 확정/반려와 코멘트를 저장합니다.</p>
        <div class="status-flow" aria-label="참고 개발진도 흐름">
          <div class="status-node">개발접수</div><div class="status-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="status-node">분석/개발</div><div class="status-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="status-node">시편승인</div><div class="status-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="status-node">사양승인</div><div class="status-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="status-node">BOM등록</div><div class="status-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="status-node">개발완료대기</div><div class="status-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="status-node">개발완료</div>
        </div>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>상태</th><th>화면에서 해석할 수 있는 의미</th><th>사용자 확인사항</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td><span class="badge">개발접수</span></td><td>영업담당자가 요청을 등록한 최초 단계</td><td>의뢰내용과 단계별 담당부서 지정 확인</td></tr>
              <tr><td><span class="badge">분석/개발</span></td><td>담당부서가 요청사항을 분석하고 개발하는 단계</td><td>검토 결과와 코멘트 기록</td></tr>
              <tr><td><span class="badge yellow">시편승인</span></td><td>시편 검토/승인 단계로 표시된 건</td><td>시편 결과와 승인 주체 확인</td></tr>
              <tr><td><span class="badge blue">사양승인</span></td><td>제품 사양 검토/승인 단계로 표시된 건</td><td>최종 사양과 고객 요구사항 일치 여부 확인</td></tr>
